01:26:18.447 --> 01:26:22.559
rate. This was a significant change from past years.

01:26:22.727 --> 01:26:25.959
There is a real concern within the community that

01:26:26.007 --> 01:26:29.463
many, many groups, regardless whether they are from the

01:26:29.519 --> 01:26:33.623
