I did send it to Councilor Clausen

01:31:08.789 --> 01:31:12.501
to consider moving it, but let's just do this one first. And then.

01:31:12.573 --> 01:31:15.917
And then, if it's up to you, if you want to move the. The other

01:31:15.981 --> 01:31:18.545
