to move it? Okay.

01:31:40.535 --> 01:31:43.663
Clerks, if you could put it up. I wrote it on

01:31:43.679 --> 01:31:44.475
the fly,

01:31:47.255 --> 01:31:50.609
but I kind of harnessed Downer

01:31:50.657 --> 01:31:53.205
and Karan a little bit.

01:32:04.105 --> 01:32:07.585
No. Because it's reflective of this. We're still on the same topic.

01:32:07.625 --> 01:32:11.033
Right. Does someone want to second this one?

01:32:11.129 --> 01:32:12.365
Okay, call her.

01:32:17.035 --> 01:32:19.415
Okay. I'm going to call the vote on that.

01:32:20.035 --> 01:32:22.055
Does anyone disagree with that?

01:32:23.155 --> 01:32:24.935
O'Rourke, Gibson,

01:32:25.635 --> 01:32:28.619
Billings. Okay, that passes.

01:32:28.747 --> 01:32:29.895
We're moving on.

01:32:34.435 --> 01:32:37.095
Okay. Clausen, it's still you. You're in the hot seat.

01:32:38.395 --> 01:32:41.635
This one is raising the 2025 budget.

01:32:41.675 --> 01:32:45.665
So this is an impact by increasing the operating budget by 100k

01:32:45.825 --> 01:32:49.521
