01:32:52.385 --> 01:32:55.665
Can I. Can I say something quickly? Of course. I just.

01:32:55.785 --> 01:32:58.937
I just need to put on the floor first. Okay, so you are. You are

01:32:58.961 --> 01:33:01.245
