01:33:34.383 --> 01:33:37.421
And I think these are important things for the

01:33:37.453 --> 01:33:41.021
community. And if we don't, I think as part of our public

01:33:41.053 --> 01:33:44.381
art policy, one of the things that we say is that

01:33:44.413 --> 01:33:48.309
