01:34:18.035 --> 01:34:22.147
year, but this is for 2025,

01:34:22.291 --> 01:34:24.815
and I hope that it will be supported.

01:34:25.765 --> 01:34:28.305
Okay, O'Rourke and then Karan.

01:34:29.725 --> 01:34:34.845
Thank you, Marigothri. So Councillor Hasan

01:34:34.965 --> 01:34:38.493
