01:34:57.197 --> 01:35:02.377
Montreal. Montreal. I think there are opportunities through the downtown rebuilding

01:35:02.481 --> 01:35:05.961
to see at that time if there's a great year

01:35:05.993 --> 01:35:09.925
and we have funds for public art to do it. And in all our major

01:35:11.545 --> 01:35:15.745
capital projects, there are allocations built in for public art.

01:35:15.865 --> 01:35:19.233
And so I'm just not comfortable supporting this

01:35:19.329 --> 01:35:22.537
this year. So I'll be voting against. Thank you.

01:35:22.561 --> 01:35:25.045
And Karan, please. And then after Karan, Kate,

01:35:25.505 --> 01:35:28.881
