01:35:40.761 --> 01:35:44.577
that have public art in their parks and in different locations all

01:35:44.601 --> 01:35:48.065
throughout the city, I realize how far we've fallen behind.

01:35:48.185 --> 01:35:51.863
And I think for me, this one is

01:35:52.049 --> 01:35:55.531
because we are opening the new library and public art

01:35:55.603 --> 01:35:58.755
is not included in the new library, in the public space.

01:35:58.875 --> 01:36:02.395
And so I can actually see that this is earmarked for specific purpose.

01:36:02.515 --> 01:36:06.259
We are creating all this new space in and around our library

01:36:06.307 --> 01:36:09.523
that is public space. And we don't have a budget to

01:36:09.579 --> 01:36:12.891
