01:37:20.695 --> 01:37:24.687
that they have to provide

01:37:24.751 --> 01:37:27.999
funding for public art or engage in public

01:37:28.047 --> 01:37:31.799
art? I know some cities do that. I think Vancouver

01:37:31.847 --> 01:37:35.815
is one of them. That wherever you build, you have to provide some

01:37:35.855 --> 01:37:38.315
public art. I just wondered if we have that policy.

01:37:40.325 --> 01:37:43.445
So through the mayor to Councillor Downer, our public art policy speaks only to

01:37:43.485 --> 01:37:47.037
city owned facilities and assets. And so we do have

01:37:47.061 --> 01:37:50.829
that public art policy. It was originally approved in 2011 and then updated,

01:37:50.957 --> 01:37:54.581
I believe in 2023, so last year. But it speaks

01:37:54.613 --> 01:37:57.573
